{"id":"c924a0bbc6eed2cd","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-kleene-o.md","title":"Kleene's O","display":"df-kleene-o — Kleene's O","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-kleene-o","aliases":["72-df-kleene-o"],"display":"df-kleene-o — Kleene's O","depends_on":["[[72-df-recursive-function]]","[[72-df-inductive-definition]]","[[72-df-acceptable-numbering]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Standard Kleene O positive simultaneous generation; book Ch.III effective ordinal background; exact source pending","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"local monotone-construction reviewed; ordinal valuation argument outlined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_kind":"supplementary-primary-or-local-derivation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-kleene-o"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-kleene-o</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-kleene-o — Kleene's O"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f38fcd2964b78d6c\" href=\"?note=f38fcd2964b78d6c\" title=\"72-df-recursive-function\">72-df-recursive-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bf103f8baf1db1b8\" href=\"?note=bf103f8baf1db1b8\" title=\"72-df-inductive-definition\">72-df-inductive-definition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bf141a6daa8808bc\" href=\"?note=bf141a6daa8808bc\" title=\"72-df-acceptable-numbering\">72-df-acceptable-numbering</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Standard Kleene O positive simultaneous generation; book Ch.III effective ordinal background; exact source pending"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local monotone-construction reviewed; ordinal valuation argument outlined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"supplementary-primary-or-local-derivation"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bf141a6daa8808bc\" href=\"?note=bf141a6daa8808bc\" title=\"72-df-acceptable-numbering\">72-df-acceptable-numbering</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Acceptable}(\\Phi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Acceptable}(\\Phi)\\)</span>；本文件以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi_e\">\\(\\phi_e\\)</span> 记同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_e\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi_e(n)\">\\(\\phi_e(n)\\)</span> 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\operatorname{Dom}_\\Phi(e)\">\\(n\\in\\operatorname{Dom}_\\Phi(e)\\)</span> 时取唯一值，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi_e\\downarrow\">\\(\\phi_e\\downarrow\\)</span> 表示该一元部分函数全定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\omega^2\">\\(R\\subseteq\\omega^2\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TC}\">\\(\\operatorname{TC}\\)</span> 是 Assertion 所定义的不自动添反身边的有限路径闭包。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_0,F_1\">\\(F_0,F_1\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\times\\mathcal P(\\omega^2)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\times\\mathcal P(\\omega^2)\\)</span> 上同时定义；该积格按分量包含排序。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K_O\">\\(\\mathcal K_O\\)</span> 是下式的前不动点对集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O\">\\(\\mathcal O\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_O\">\\(&lt;_O\\)</span> 分别取其分量交。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_O:\\mathcal O\\to\\operatorname{Ord}\">\\(v_O:\\mathcal O\\to\\operatorname{Ord}\\)</span> 按所显示的唯一构造分支作良基递归，零码、后继码和极限码的适用范围在各式中限定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TC}(R):=\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in\\omega^2:\\exists k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\ \\exists t\\in\\omega^{k+1}\\ (t_0=a\\land t_k=b\\land\\forall i&lt;k\\ \\langle t_i,t_{i+1}\\rangle\\in R)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TC}(R):=\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in\\omega^2:\\exists k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\ \\exists t\\in\\omega^{k+1}\\ (t_0=a\\land t_k=b\\land\\forall i&lt;k\\ \\langle t_i,t_{i+1}\\rangle\\in R)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nL(A,R)&amp;:=\\{e\\in\\omega:\\phi_e\\downarrow\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (\\phi_e(n)\\in A\\land\\langle\\phi_e(n),\\phi_e(n+1)\\rangle\\in R)\\},\\\\\nF_0(A,R)&amp;:=A\\cup\\{1\\}\\cup\\{2^a:a\\in A\\}\\cup\\{3\\cdot5^e:e\\in L(A,R)\\},\\\\\nF_1(A,R)&amp;:=\\operatorname{TC}\\bigl(R\\cup\\{\\langle a,2^a\\rangle:a\\in A\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\phi_e(n),3\\cdot5^e\\rangle:e\\in L(A,R),\\ n\\in\\omega\\}\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathcal K_O&amp;:=\\{\\langle A,R\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\times\\mathcal P(\\omega^2):F_0(A,R)\\subseteq A\\land F_1(A,R)\\subseteq R\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal O&amp;:=\\bigcap\\{A:\\exists R\\ (\\langle A,R\\rangle\\in\\mathcal K_O)\\},\\\\\n&lt;_O&amp;:=\\bigcap\\{R:\\exists A\\ (\\langle A,R\\rangle\\in\\mathcal K_O)\\},\\\\\nv_O(1)&amp;:=0,\\qquad v_O(2^a):=v_O(a)+1\\quad(a\\in\\mathcal O),\\\\\nv_O(3\\cdot5^e)&amp;:=\\sup\\{v_O(\\phi_e(n)):n\\in\\omega\\}\\quad(e\\in L(\\mathcal O,&lt;_O)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nL(A,R)&amp;:=\\{e\\in\\omega:\\phi_e\\downarrow\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (\\phi_e(n)\\in A\\land\\langle\\phi_e(n),\\phi_e(n+1)\\rangle\\in R)\\},\\\\\nF_0(A,R)&amp;:=A\\cup\\{1\\}\\cup\\{2^a:a\\in A\\}\\cup\\{3\\cdot5^e:e\\in L(A,R)\\},\\\\\nF_1(A,R)&amp;:=\\operatorname{TC}\\bigl(R\\cup\\{\\langle a,2^a\\rangle:a\\in A\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\phi_e(n),3\\cdot5^e\\rangle:e\\in L(A,R),\\ n\\in\\omega\\}\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathcal K_O&amp;:=\\{\\langle A,R\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\times\\mathcal P(\\omega^2):F_0(A,R)\\subseteq A\\land F_1(A,R)\\subseteq R\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal O&amp;:=\\bigcap\\{A:\\exists R\\ (\\langle A,R\\rangle\\in\\mathcal K_O)\\},\\\\\n&lt;_O&amp;:=\\bigcap\\{R:\\exists A\\ (\\langle A,R\\rangle\\in\\mathcal K_O)\\},\\\\\nv_O(1)&amp;:=0,\\qquad v_O(2^a):=v_O(a)+1\\quad(a\\in\\mathcal O),\\\\\nv_O(3\\cdot5^e)&amp;:=\\sup\\{v_O(\\phi_e(n)):n\\in\\omega\\}\\quad(e\\in L(\\mathcal O,&lt;_O)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>已核对Sacks作者专著I§2.1的最小正关系生成及§2.2–§2.3的良基/赋值证明。本节点分成O与R两个同步分量，与该文取R之field的版本逐阶段对应。关键修复：极限程序要求φ_e(n)&lt;_Oφ_e(n+1)，不能先按未知语义值严格增长再反过来定义&lt;_O。F对两分量正，幂集积格最小不动点存在。按生成阶段同时赋值：后继值加1，极限是严格增长已有链的上确界，每条新边严格增加值；有限传递闭包也保持这一性质，故无下降链，沿其递归定义v_O。三种数码外形互异，且每个后继/极限码确定其前件或索引，故多次生成不会赋不同值。这里只记录标准KleeneO生成定义；全部递归序数覆盖与非递归性需额外定理，本节点未将其当作已证明结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"f38fcd2964b78d6c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-inductive-definition","status":"resolved","id":"bf103f8baf1db1b8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-inductive-definition]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-acceptable-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"bf141a6daa8808bc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-acceptable-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-acceptable-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"bf141a6daa8808bc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-acceptable-numbering]] 的 $\\Phi$，满足 $\\operatorname{Acceptable}(\\Phi)$；本文件以 $\\phi_e$ 记同一 $\\varphi_e$。$\\phi_e(n)$ 只在 $n\\in\\operatorname{Dom}_\\Phi(e)$ 时取唯一值，$\\phi_e\\downarrow$ 表示该一元部分函数全定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Acceptable}(\\Phi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi_e(n)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\operatorname{Dom}_\\Phi(e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi_e\\downarrow","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq\\omega^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TC}","display":false},{"tex":"F_0,F_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\times\\mathcal P(\\omega^2)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K_O","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal O","display":false},{"tex":"<_O","display":false},{"tex":"v_O:\\mathcal O\\to\\operatorname{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TC}(R):=\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in\\omega^2:\\exists k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\ \\exists t\\in\\omega^{k+1}\\ (t_0=a\\land t_k=b\\land\\forall i<k\\ \\langle t_i,t_{i+1}\\rangle\\in R)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nL(A,R)&:=\\{e\\in\\omega:\\phi_e\\downarrow\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (\\phi_e(n)\\in A\\land\\langle\\phi_e(n),\\phi_e(n+1)\\rangle\\in R)\\},\\\\\nF_0(A,R)&:=A\\cup\\{1\\}\\cup\\{2^a:a\\in A\\}\\cup\\{3\\cdot5^e:e\\in L(A,R)\\},\\\\\nF_1(A,R)&:=\\operatorname{TC}\\bigl(R\\cup\\{\\langle a,2^a\\rangle:a\\in A\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\phi_e(n),3\\cdot5^e\\rangle:e\\in L(A,R),\\ n\\in\\omega\\}\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathcal K_O&:=\\{\\langle A,R\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\times\\mathcal P(\\omega^2):F_0(A,R)\\subseteq A\\land F_1(A,R)\\subseteq R\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal O&:=\\bigcap\\{A:\\exists R\\ (\\langle A,R\\rangle\\in\\mathcal K_O)\\},\\\\\n<_O&:=\\bigcap\\{R:\\exists A\\ (\\langle A,R\\rangle\\in\\mathcal K_O)\\},\\\\\nv_O(1)&:=0,\\qquad v_O(2^a):=v_O(a)+1\\quad(a\\in\\mathcal O),\\\\\nv_O(3\\cdot5^e)&:=\\sup\\{v_O(\\phi_e(n)):n\\in\\omega\\}\\quad(e\\in L(\\mathcal O,<_O)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3367,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-125","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-kleene-o|df-kleene-o — Kleene's O]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-125","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-kleene-o|df-kleene-o — Kleene's O]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-98","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-kleene-o|72-df-kleene-o]]"}],"outgoing":["f38fcd2964b78d6c","bf103f8baf1db1b8","bf141a6daa8808bc"]}